	{
		"name": "execute",
		"title": "Execute raw Lix SQL",
		"description": "Execute an ordered batch of caller-provided Lix SQL statements atomically against the lix's active Lix branch. To change branches, call switch_branch first. Each statement has its own parameters and produces one ordered result; if any statement fails, the complete batch rolls back. SQL can read or mutate any SQL-accessible branch data. Lix SQL does not support DDL statements.\n\nCore tables:\n- `lix_file` — Current files in the active branch. Columns: `id, path, directory_id, name, data (binary)`.\n- `lix_directory` — Current directories in the active branch. Columns: `id, path, parent_id, name`.\n- `lix_branch` — Lix branches and their current commits. Columns: `id, name, hidden, commit_id`.\n- `lix_change` — Global immutable change ledger; use it for activity and audit. Columns: `id, entity_pk, schema_key, file_id, snapshot_content, metadata, created_at, origin_key`.\n\nPath rules: `lix_file.path` never ends in `/`; `lix_directory.path` always does. `lix_file.directory_id` references `lix_directory.id`; `lix_directory.parent_id` references `lix_directory.id`. Use those IDs for hierarchy queries.\n\n`lix_file.data` is binary. Pass binary values as `{\"kind\":\"blob\",\"base64\":\"...\"}`. Never use `CAST(... AS BLOB)`; if a SQL cast is unavoidable, use `BYTEA`.\n\nTo create or replace a file, pass one statement with SQL `INSERT OR REPLACE INTO lix_file (path, data) VALUES ($1, $2)`. Encode `$1` as `{\"kind\":\"text\",\"value\":\"/example.md\"}` and the file bytes in `$2` with the blob parameter above. To verify a write, read that exact path with `SELECT path, data FROM lix_file WHERE path = $1` and the same text parameter.\n\nUse the core tables above, plus their `_by_branch` / `_history` companions, directly; do not inspect `information_schema` for them.\n\nEntity tables are lix-dynamic: do not assume a fixed entity-table list or column shape. Only when a task needs an entity table, discover its table name, then inspect only that table:\n\n```sql\nSELECT table_name, table_type\nFROM information_schema.tables\nWHERE table_schema = 'public'\nORDER BY table_name;\n```\n\n```sql\nSELECT column_name, data_type, is_nullable, ordinal_position\nFROM information_schema.columns\nWHERE table_schema = 'public'\n  AND table_name = $1\nORDER BY ordinal_position;\n```\n\nSystem `lixcol_*` metadata is intentionally omitted from the core guide. Where present, `<table>_by_branch` adds `lixcol_branch_id` for cross-branch reads and writes. `<table>_history` is read-only: scope every history query with `WHERE lixcol_start_commit_id = lix_active_branch_commit_id()`, then constrain it by stable identity (`id = $n` for files/directories or `lixcol_entity_pk = $n` for entities) resolved from the active table. That avoids `LIX_HISTORY_NON_IDENTITY_FILTER` and preserves renamed/tombstoned history. Read a current item's `lixcol_change_id` from its active table, not an historical row; use `lixcol_depth` / `lixcol_observed_commit_id` for prior revisions.",
		"inputSchema": {
			"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
			"type": "object",
			"properties": {
				"lix_ref": {
					"type": "string",
					"description": "Exact lix UUID, exact lix slug, or exact @namespace/slug. Use the lix UUID when available."
				},
				"statements": {
					"minItems": 1,
					"maxItems": 100,
					"type": "array",
					"items": {
						"type": "object",
						"properties": {
							"sql": {
								"type": "string",
								"minLength": 1
							},
							"params": {
								"default": [],
								"maxItems": 1000,
								"type": "array",
								"items": {
									"oneOf": [
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "null"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "null"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "bool"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "boolean"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "int"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "integer",
													"minimum": -9007199254740991,
													"maximum": 9007199254740991
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "float"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "number"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "text"
												},
												"value": {
													"type": "string"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "blob"
												},
												"base64": {
													"type": "string"
												}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "base64"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										},
										{
											"type": "object",
											"properties": {
												"kind": {
													"type": "string",
													"const": "json"
												},
												"value": {}
											},
											"required": ["kind", "value"],
											"additionalProperties": false
										}
									]
								}
							}
						},
						"required": ["sql"],
						"additionalProperties": false
					}
				}
			},
			"required": ["lix_ref", "statements"],
			"additionalProperties": false
		},
		"outputSchema": {
			"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
			"anyOf": [
				{
					"type": "object",
					"properties": {
						"results": {
							"type": "array",
							"items": {
								"type": "object",
								"properties": {
									"columns": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {
											"type": "string"
										}
									},
									"rows": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {
											"type": "array",
											"items": {
												"oneOf": [
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "null"
															},
															"value": {
																"type": "null"
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "bool"
															},
															"value": {
																"type": "boolean"
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "int"
															},
															"value": {
																"type": "integer",
																"minimum": -9007199254740991,
																"maximum": 9007199254740991
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "float"
															},
															"value": {
																"type": "number"
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "text"
															},
															"value": {
																"type": "string"
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "blob"
															},
															"base64": {
																"type": "string"
															}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "base64"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													},
													{
														"type": "object",
														"properties": {
															"kind": {
																"type": "string",
																"const": "json"
															},
															"value": {}
														},
														"required": ["kind", "value"],
														"additionalProperties": false
													}
												]
											}
										}
									},
									"rowsAffected": {
										"type": "integer",
										"minimum": 0,
										"maximum": 9007199254740991
									},
									"notices": {
										"type": "array",
										"items": {}
